        <body>
            <div xml:id="d274">

                <pb facs="0327" n="251" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg251"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.51/1753</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-17">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 17, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Minister of Finance states that he cannot give authority to Receiver for
                    collection of internal revenue, and Council of Ministers protest categorically
                    against control of finances as established by us.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
